  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support programme for the development of family farming in Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a continuation of MLIB17 with main objective is to increase income, as well as the  strengthening the power to act and influence of 1600 women enrolled in 3 value chains: Milk, Rice and Soya,  in the region of Koulikoro, Koutiala and Segou.</narrative>
  </description>
